From de6d3a9821eb73ecb98da8788d201df9ae3dce4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 24 May 2026 06:12:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add lead capture: collect visitor's name+phone after
 save-contact
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New leads table in db.js with card_id FK
- POST /api/leads (public) — validated insert with UA, IP, country (Netlify x-nf-geo header)
- GET /api/cards/:slug/leads (admin) — list leads for a card
- DELETE /api/leads/:id (admin)
- Card page: modal opens 1.4s after save-contact click, fields: имя + телефон, dismissable, anonymous visitor_id stored in localStorage so the modal isn't shown twice
- Admin: new 'Лиды' section in card edit view with list, device/country, quick WhatsApp link, delete button
---
